  <text id="local-title" x="490" y="316" width="260" height="30" font="body" size="21" color="#FFFFFF" wrap="false">Local auth boundary</text>
  <text id="local-body" x="490" y="366" width="248" height="84" font="body" size="17" color="#D9E6DF" line-height="1.36">Local and blank-config checks both stopped at the existing secure sign-in gateway; no dashboard was exposed without a session.</text>
